{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"理元类群"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"理元类群"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>数域 $K$ 的理元类群 $C_K$ 是其对应的"},{"Local":{"url":"算术曲线","text":"算术曲线"}},{"Plain":"上的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Picard群","text":"Picard 群"}},{"Plain":" (线丛的"},{"Local":{"url":"模空间","text":"模空间"}},{"Plain":"的 $0$-"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性(同伦类型论)","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"数域","text":"数域"}},{"Plain":" $K$ 的<strong>理元类群</strong> (idèle class group) $C_K$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"Idèle","text":"理元群"}},{"Plain":"对乘法群 $K^\\times$ 的商:\n$$\r\nC_K := \\mathbb{I}_K / K^\\times.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}